# Mirrors netlify.toml's redirects as a belt-and-suspenders: netlify.toml is only
# applied when Netlify runs its own build from the connected repo. A manual/API
# deploy of a pre-built dist/ skips that processing entirely, so without this file
# living inside dist/ (Vite copies public/ verbatim), /api/* has nowhere to go and
# every request from the frontend 404s — including login.
/api/*  https://coachconnect-backend-c3jx.onrender.com/api/:splat  200!
/*      /index.html                                                200
